Output docs/assets/jobs.gif

Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Width 1800
Set Height 1000
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20

Type "c9s --demo-data"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type ":"
Sleep 500ms
Type "images"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 300ms
Type "p"
Sleep 2s

Type ":"
Sleep 500ms
Type "jobs"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
Type "q"
